(Nimbus R2 'Kestrel' - Product Guide \(fictional product\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What is the Kestrel?) Tj T*
(The Kestrel is an indoor inventory drone for warehouses. It scans shelf barcodes and RFID) Tj T*
(tags while flying a pre-planned route and syncs results to the Nimbus Cloud.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Battery and charging) Tj T*
(The Kestrel flies for 38 minutes on one charge. A full recharge on the docking station) Tj T*
(takes 55 minutes. The battery is rated for about 900 charge cycles before capacity drops) Tj T*
(below 80%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Pricing) Tj T*
(The Kestrel costs 7,900 EUR per unit. The Nimbus Cloud subscription costs 149 EUR per) Tj T*
(drone per month. Customers ordering 10 or more drones get a 12% discount on hardware.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
