(Warranty) Tj T*
(Hardware comes with a 2-year warranty. Damage caused by collisions is not covered unless) Tj T*
(the customer bought the 'CrashCare' add-on \(19 EUR per drone per month\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Troubleshooting: error code E-42) Tj T*
(E-42 means the drone lost its positioning signal. Move the drone within 15 meters of an) Tj T*
(anchor beacon and restart it. If E-42 persists, recalibrate the beacons from the Nimbus) Tj T*
(Cloud dashboard under Settings > Beacons > Recalibrate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Troubleshooting: error code E-17) Tj T*
(E-17 means a propeller is blocked or damaged. Power off the drone, inspect all four) Tj T*
(propellers and replace any cracked one. Spare propeller sets cost 39 EUR.) Tj T*
ET
